        "quote": "(a) Authority to Remove. Any law enforcement officer is hereby authorized to remove or cause to be removed to the nearest garage, the police impound lot, or other place of safety, any vehicle found upon a street, road, alley or highway in the City when such vehicle is parked illegally in violation of signs prohibiting such parking, or if such vehicle is interfering with, or would soon interfere with, street or utility construction, street or utility maintenance, painting of street lines or traffic control devices, or any planned maintenance work on utilities.",
