          "end": 888,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.05.050:block:1",
          "start": 566
        },
        "quote": "(b) Interference with Emergency Work on Streets or Utilities. Any law enforcement officer may remove to a garage, police impound lot or other place of safety, any vehicle which is parked in such a manner as to interfere with emergency work on streets or utilities, regardless if such vehicle was otherwise lawfully parked.",
