        "quote": "(c) Notification of Vehicle Removal. Notification of such vehicle removal, assessment of towing fees and storage charges, challenges to such removal and disposal of unclaimed vehicles removed pursuant to this section shall be in accordance with the procedures established in Chapter 10.25 TMC. (Code 1981 § 43-5. Code 1995 § 142-5.)",
